OL,3,GNEWSAMan killed by car in Lidl crash
OL,4,Awas inside store
OL,5,
OL,6,FA man in his 30s was killed inside a
OL,7,FLidl store when a car crashed through
OL,8,Fthe entrance in Wolverhampton, an
OL,9,Fambulance service has said.
OL,11,FThe man was pronounced dead at the
OL,12,Fscene after the crash, which West
OL,13,FMidlands Ambulance Service was called
OL,14,Fto just before 18:00 BST on Friday.
OL,16,FThe service said the woman who was
OL,17,Fdriving the car is believed to have had
OL,18,Fa medical incident at the wheel. She
OL,19,Fwas treated at the scene before being
OL,20,Ftaken to hospital for further
OL,21,Ftreatment.
OL,23,APub: 24-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
