OL,3,GNEWSAMan killed by car in Lidl crash
OL,4,Awas inside store
OL,5,
OL,6,FIn a statement, Lidl said it was
OL,7,Fsaddened by the incident and said the
OL,8,Fstore would remain closed until further
OL,9,Fnotice.
